  <p id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001:m0000" ref="war_qdw_fs5">陸倕</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001:m0003" ref="war_qdw_fs5">佐公</persName>，吳郡吳人也。晉太尉<persName id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001:m0015" ref="u3v_t2p_tcu">玩</persName>六世孫。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001:m0021" ref="jss_82r_1ct_A">子真</persName>，宋東陽太守。父<persName id="c-liangshu-027-lushan-chui:p001:m0031" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AA">慧曉</persName>，齊太常卿。</p>
